92
00:07:27,291 --> 00:07:28,651
No, I do!

93
00:07:28,911 --> 00:07:31,551
It's perfectly natural for a guy to worry...

94
00:07:31,551 --> 00:07:34,331
about his bungling kid brother.

95
00:07:35,591 --> 00:07:37,591
He might be a bit much for all of you to handle.

96
00:07:38,671 --> 00:07:40,471
But take good care of him for me.

97
00:07:42,131 --> 00:07:44,311
