129
00:09:27,051 --> 00:09:27,551
Luffy!

130
00:09:27,551 --> 00:09:28,051
Luffy!

131
00:09:28,051 --> 00:09:28,151
Luffy!

132
00:09:28,151 --> 00:09:28,551
Luffy!

133
00:09:28,551 --> 00:09:29,151
Luffy!

134
00:09:29,151 --> 00:09:29,551
Luffy!

135
