152
00:10:55,911 --> 00:11:12,911
What a foolish man you are. You don't know anything, do you? Now listen, that was only conjecture at this point. I don't have any proof, but I'd say that battle is a high probability.

153
00:11:12,911 --> 00:11:20,911
The world government has laid out their bait, but Captain Whitebeard would never ever allow his maids to be killed.

154
00:11:20,911 --> 00:11:29,911
But even with that knowledge, they have announced the public execution of Port Custee Ace, a powerful and high-ranking commander in his crew.

155
00:11:31,911 --> 00:11:33,911
