176
00:13:23,611 --> 00:13:28,491
And yet here you are. Fate decided to save you instead.

177
00:13:28,991 --> 00:13:32,571
Better make sure you pay your humble respects at his grave, Straw Hat.

178
00:13:33,331 --> 00:13:37,431
He went and took your place for you, because if it weren't for your brother,

179
00:13:38,391 --> 00:13:40,811
you'd be dead and he'd be walking free.

180
00:13:40,911 --> 00:13:45,891
I knew the pirate that Blackbeard killed.

181
00:13:46,331 --> 00:13:49,431
He was the commander of the 4th Division of the Whitebeard Pirates.

182
00:13:49,751 --> 00:13:53,471
Went by the name of Thatch. He was a loyal friend and good-hearted.

183
00:13:54,771 --> 00:13:59,051
Captain Whitebeard and I go back a long ways, and I owe the old salt a great debt,

184
00:13:59,451 --> 00:14:01,511
so I would often visit his ship back then.

185
00:14:02,251 --> 00:14:05,711
But I didn't notice what Teach was up to until it was too late.

186
00:14:05,711 --> 00:14:11,131
And it was then that Ace sailed out alone after Blackbeard.

187
00:14:11,971 --> 00:14:15,551
As the commander of the 2nd Division of the Whitebeard Pirates,

188
00:14:15,891 --> 00:14:18,531
