208
00:16:11,551 --> 00:16:14,431
If you stick with me, I swear we can rule the world.

209
00:16:14,751 --> 00:16:16,911
Whitebeard's days are numbered and you know it.

210
00:16:16,911 --> 00:16:19,251
I'm going to be King of the Pirates.

211
00:16:19,531 --> 00:16:24,791
First, I'm headed off to Water 7 to kill Straw Hat Luffy as a special gift to the world government.

212
